{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは🙂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、ロッキンでした!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMCMZJYT4S59WVFBFB3MQY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のライブでは、2回目のアンビバレントの披露がありました!\nこれからもっと沢山やっていきたいな😌\n暑かったけど、昨日のライブは楽しすぎて暑さを忘れてしまってました☀️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"客席がすごーく暑そうだったので熱中症気をつけてね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りなちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMCNZH7VAQVVDR77EWN87K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n2つ結びすごく良い💮\n結ぶと夏ぽい感じする!\n今日のライブは髪を下ろしてたのですが暑い日のライブは髪を結んだ方が踊りやすいんですよね。\nそのうち、結び姿が見れるかも･･･?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すき!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMCQ19XJNVBB3T2ZJ2C9CD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMCQZJPZBX6RE7Y6NXHC2E","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n自己規制⚠️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恒例のメロンもちゃんと食べました!\n幸せでした。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMCRXPCBWN3K1EX5934VDF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n溶け。\n食欲がそそられますね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}